Description:

Fixed an off-by-one in the bounds check that reinserts the "magic plus" suffix
into a canonicalized username, which failed to account for the trailing NUL.
This was reachable only with :imapdconf:`imapmagicplus` (imapd) or
:imapdconf:`popsubfolders` (pop3d) enabled, both of which default to off.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-m586-8hm8-vq2x.


